== Effects ==
* +1 [[damage]].
* Increases the chance for [[champion|champion enemies]] to appear by 15%.
** Without any other champion enemy appearance modifiers the chance increases from 5% to 20% ({{dlc|nr}} 20% to 35% in [[hard mode]]).

== Notes ==
* While more champions likely mean a tougher run, players will also profit from a higher amount of [[pickup]]s available to them, thanks to many champions dropping items upon death.
** Champion enemies don't drop consumables while playing Greedier mode, making Champion Belt significantly worse in that mode.
* The belt does not affect the appearance rate of champion [[boss]]es.
* This is one of the only raw DMG up's in the [[Shop (Item Pool)|shop item pool]].
* {{dlc+|a+}} The chance for champions to appear does not increase in {{s|The Void}}. It has a fixed 75% chance. {{dlc-}}
* {{dlc+|r+}} Champion Belt's quality is treated as 2 for the purposes of {{I|Bag of Crafting}}.{{dlc-}}

== Interactions ==
* {{t|Purple Heart}}: Champion Belt's increased chance is also doubled.

